        "created_at": "2018-06-15T17:15:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We all know that the Freedom Five are Absolute Zero's family. They're all true companions. But none of them are immortal. None of them, that is, except for Absolute Zero. So when Absolute Zero's family dies, what then? My theory, he finally takes off the suit. The job is done, the world has been saved several times over. They retired (well, in the miststorm universe the freedom five don't retire. Because they likely won't survive the unravveling of that universe.). They did what they had to. And now it was their time. And Absolute Zero, it's his time too.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
